                "loc": "PSA.72.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 72:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe yaagaruka yaatuma ondiijo mukuru w'engabo makumi ataano obwa kashatu hamwe n'ezo ngabo ze. Ogwo mukuru w'engabo wa kashatu yainamuka, yaashanga Eliya, yaamutsimbira amaju, yaamweshengyereza naagira ati: Ai bambe, iwe mushaija wa Ruhanga 'we, ninkweshengyereza, reka amagara gangye n'ag'abairu baawe makumi ataano gabe ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho gaawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reeba, omuriro gurugire omu iguru, gwamaraho abakuru b'engabo abambandiize hamwe n'engabo zaabo makumi ataano-ataano; kwonka mbwenu reka amagara gangye gabe ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho gaawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima maraika wa MUKAMA yaagira Eliya ati: Shuuma nawe; otamutiina. Atyo yaimuka, yaashuuma nawe aha mugabe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Waaza kutuma entumwa kukuragurizisa ahari Baali-zebubi, ruhanga wa Ekurooni, omuri Israeli habaire hatarimu Ruhanga w'okwehanuuzaho? Ahabw'ekyo torikwija kuruga aha kishego eki oriho; buzimazima noija kufa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
